    "source": "tlaplus/Examples 6a7b26a31c1a6aeec789b455e9bbfa3b3ad2728f, specifications/KeyValueStore. Both Rust exporters were built from the same main base, pinned Rust, --locked --release -p dive-api --example symbolic_input, with LTO disabled and 16 codegen units. The final differs only by the reachable-binding change.",
    "host": "AWS EC2 c7i.4xlarge, Intel Xeon Platinum 8488C, Ubuntu 24.04, 16 online logical CPUs. Exporter-only samples pinned to CPU 4 in us-east-2; installed CLI controls on a second c7i.4xlarge, CPU 6 in us-east-1. Other tasks on each host used separate affinities. Times include fresh process startup.",
    "limits": "Exporter controls: 1,153,433,600-byte address-space limit and 1,400 MiB cgroup, no swap. Full-check library cases: 1,100 MiB checker address-space budget, 1,400 MiB cgroup, 35 s deadline. Tiny trace and startup controls: cgroup without address-space limit. Rows use GNU time wall seconds and peak RSS KiB.",
    "commands": [
      "symbolic_input MCKVS.tla Model.cfg",
      "dive check Library.tla --config Library.cfg --strategy symbolic --output json --time-limit 35s --max-memory 1100m",
      "dive check MCKVS.tla --config Model.cfg --strategy symbolic --prove-inductive --time-limit 35s --max-memory 1100m --output json"
    ]
  },
